olution" "value" "First, we express the given information in terms of $Φ:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(Z\\le z) & =0.999 \\\\ Φ(z) & =0.999\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we are looking for the value of $z$ such that\n\n$$\nz={Φ}^{-1}(0.999).\n$$\n\nWe look for the column in the table that corresponds to $p=0.999,$ and we find that\n\n$$\np=0.999\\,⇒\\,{Φ}^{-1}(p)=3.0902.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nz={Φ}^{-1}(0.999)=3.0902.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96936" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5788a43d39efd18f8569ede86ccb8514d5f74b2c33530e746849caf8e813c650"} {"question" "q-96936" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96936" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2.3263"] ["math" "2.5758"] ["math" "3.0902"] ["math" "3.0929"] ["math" "3.2905"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96936" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3.0902"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975