" "q-96948" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5788a43d39efd18f8569ede86ccb8514d5f74b2c33530e746849caf8e813c650"} {"question" "q-96948" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96948" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0.2533"] ["math" "0.4522"] ["math" "0.5244"] ["math" "1.2816"] ["math" "1.8016"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96948" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0.5244"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070279/state.json" "file_sha256" "7e082324addbb527d625ee03ef823a1467f051401aca243ea9d229e975440f35"} {"question" "q-96962" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The table below gives the values of ${Φ}^{-1}(p)$ for different values of $p,$ where $p=Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. Find the value of $z$ such that $P(Z\\le z)=0.025.$\n\n| $\\,p\\,$ | $0.965$ | $0.970$ | $0.975$ | $0.980$ | $0.985$ | $0.990$ | $0.995$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${Φ}^{-1}(p)$ | $\\,1.8119\\,$ | $\\,1.8808\\,$ | $\\,1.9600\\,$ | $\\,2.0537\\,$ | $\\,2.1701\\,$ | $\\,2.3263\\,$ | $\\,2.5758\\,$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Acade